  "published": "2026-10-21T20:49:07.57Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.2: maintenance release on top of 1.5.1 (cue-layout parity fixes), which made real multisession rips encode byte-identically to chdman createcd. 1.5.2 cleans the whole solution under jb inspectcode (0 warnings/errors, was 308): vendored codecs are exempted from style inspections to protect byte-for-byte chdman parity, consumer-facing models are exempted from \"never used\" inspections, and first-party findings (redundant null checks, dead tester state) were fixed. CI now also syncs the docs/ wiki and requests a Pages rebuild on every push to main. No public API changes. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
